/-!
# A184187

Triangle read by rows: row n contains the coefficients (of the increasing powers of the variable) of the characteristic polynomial of the distance matrix of the rooted tree having Matula-Göbel number n.

The 69 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A184187

